{"id":"n66267-1-9","stage":1,"title":"돌려주다 · 还给","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66267-1-9-1","ko":"지수야, 아까 내가 유민이한테 빌린 볼펜 네가 돌려줬니?","zh":"智秀，刚才我向裕敏借的圆珠笔，是你还给她的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"유민이한테","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"유민이한테","audio":"/audio/9388c7d35a27cb88a6df.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이한테","audio":"/audio/9388c7d35a27cb88a6df.mp3"}},{"text":"빌린","meaning":"借","explanation":"빌리다：借；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌린","audio":"/audio/85701e9851b88be05440.mp3"}},{"text":"볼펜","meaning":"圆珠笔","explanation":"볼펜：圆珠笔。","readings":[{"term":"볼펜","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59469","senseId":"1","lemma":"볼펜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"볼펜","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"돌려줬니?","meaning":"还给，归还，退还","explanation":"돌려주다：还给，归还，退还；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"돌려주다","audio":"/audio/b3f7b95886de6d800379.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66267","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌려주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌려줬니","audio":"/audio/bcdb78c07b5d7b709961.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"4ba73c1f13e77796","term":"볼펜","zh":"圆珠笔","audio":"/audio/4ba73c1f13e77796fb2e.mp3","entryId":"59469","definition":"笔尖的小钢珠随着笔的移动一起滚动、同时带出墨水来写字的一种书写工具。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b3f7b95886de6d80","term":"돌려주다","zh":"还给，归还，退还","audio":"/audio/b3f7b95886de6d800379.mp3","entryId":"66267","definition":"把借、抢或收到的财物还给原主。","pronunciation":["돌려주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5dfb68901b829c4e500d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66267-1-9-2","ko":"응. 유민이가 찾길래 내가 줬어.","zh":"嗯。因为裕敏来找，我就把笔还给她了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","